        "content": "### Interpretation\n- The data are historical, not live telemetry.\n- An empty alert table means **no unresolved alerts are currently stored**, not that the environment is proven safe.\n- Degraded status reflects rejected readings in the stored health records.\n- Smoke, CO and LPG units should be confirmed from the dataset before assigning physical units.\n- A monitoring-coverage warning is distinct from an environmental threshold alert.",
